    kearifan instrumen tradisional awi Nusantara: Karinding.\n\n\u2022 Engine: Unity
    6 (Universal Render Pipeline)\n\u2022 Visual & Artwork: Karinding Legacy Art
    Pack\n\u2022 Sora & Audio: Pelestarian Musik \xC9tnik Tradisional\n\nKembangkeun
    harmoni nada, lestarikeun warisan budaya."
